# The 47MB embeddings JSON is obsolete on-prem: those vectors are 1536-dim
# (Vercel AI Gateway) and the local model is 768-dim, so they cannot be
# reused. The migration script re-embeds from corpus.json instead. Excluding
# it keeps the build context — and the image — dramatically smaller.
src/data/corpus-embeddings.json
